00:32:53.157 --> 00:32:53.856
>> because we hate to see one

00:32:53.856 --> 00:32:56.360
of the most beautiful cities

00:32:56.360 --> 00:32:56.860
in the world tarnished by

00:32:56.860 --> 00:32:58.860
unsightly trash.

00:32:59.763 --> 00:33:00.431
We are fortunate to live in a

00:33:00.431 --> 00:33:02.831
municipality where parks are

00:33:03.967 --> 00:33:04.368
many give us a respite from the

00:33:04.368 --> 00:33:06.368
if you will.

00:33:07.270 --> 00:33:08.400
Bland, concrete, dull asphalt

00:33:08.400 --> 00:33:08.405
and rows of stucco structures

00:33:08.405 --> 00:33:10.405
that abound.

00:33:11.274 --> 00:33:11.942
Nature's beauty gives us peace

00:33:11.942 --> 00:33:14.942
of mind, promotes being one

00:33:15.613 --> 00:33:16.213
with nature and provides an

00:33:16.213 --> 00:33:16.881
escape from urban life.

00:33:16.881 --> 00:33:19.881
And indeed, you know, these

00:33:20.150 --> 00:33:20.651
chaotic times it's a very

00:33:20.651 --> 00:33:22.651
welcome respite.

00:33:23.353 --> 00:33:24.870
Now if you see me on the street

00:33:24.870 --> 00:33:26.656
or my wife with me and we're

00:33:26.656 --> 00:33:27.424
in the park with a trash bag

00:33:27.424 --> 00:33:28.158
in one hand and a picker in the

00:33:28.158 --> 00:33:29.894
other, please don't mistake us

00:33:29.894 --> 00:33:30.828
for vagrants.

00:33:30.828 --> 00:33:33.897
It has been done before so

00:33:33.897 --> 00:33:34.599
little odd.

00:33:34.599 --> 00:33:36.999
It's rather remarkable that

00:33:37.501 --> 00:33:38.302
when we are passing folks while

00:33:38.302 --> 00:33:40.804
picking up trash most ignore us

00:33:40.804 --> 00:33:41.572
or look away.

00:33:41.572 --> 00:33:42.390
Only a few will venture words

00:33:42.390 --> 00:33:44.390
of appreciation.

00:33:45.420 --> 00:33:45.709
But again we don't seek

00:33:45.709 --> 00:33:46.900
appreciation for what we're

00:33:46.900 --> 00:33:48.900
doing.

00:33:49.147 --> 00:33:49.847
We'd also like to acknowledge

00:33:49.847 --> 00:33:51.847
interestingly enough the 311

00:33:53.684 --> 00:33:54.180
act app and the developers

00:33:54.180 --> 00:33:54.719
thereof.

00:33:54.719 --> 00:33:57.655
In those cases where there are

00:33:57.655 --> 00:33:58.422
no trash bins in proximity we

00:33:58.422 --> 00:34:01.325
can pull the bags of garbage,

00:34:01.325 --> 00:34:04.195
take a photo and submit to 311.

00:34:04.195 --> 00:34:04.729
The city picks up the trash

00:34:04.729 --> 00:34:05.430
in a timely manner.

00:34:05.430 --> 00:34:07.830
Alternatively one can deposit

00:34:08.533 --> 00:34:09.234
trash in cans conveniently

00:34:09.234 --> 00:34:09.968
situated in goal and gay park

00:34:09.968 --> 00:34:11.702
and near fire stations as it

00:34:11.702 --> 00:34:12.570
were.

00:34:12.570 --> 00:34:13.304
Thus there is really no excuse

00:34:13.304 --> 00:34:15.740
for not picking up especially

00:34:15.740 --> 00:34:16.574
if you have the time.

00:34:16.574 --> 00:34:17.441
Now I don't know how to

00:34:17.441 --> 00:34:19.510
encourage others to do what we

00:34:19.510 --> 00:34:21.910
do except by example.

00:34:23.181 --> 00:34:23.915
>> I know there are organized

00:34:23.915 --> 00:34:24.549
efforts which is wonderful but

00:34:24.549 --> 00:34:26.949
for those who appreciate

00:34:28.386 --> 00:34:29.120
flexibility and issue

00:34:29.120 --> 00:34:32.900
structured groups it would be

00:34:32.900 --> 00:34:32.524
great to encourage individual

00:34:32.524 --> 00:34:33.291
contributors.

00:34:33.291 --> 00:34:35.827
I'll leave it up to others to

00:34:35.827 --> 00:34:36.460
find ways to encourage san

00:34:36.460 --> 00:34:38.860
franciscans to be good

00:34:39.765 --> 00:34:40.498
shepherds of our green spaces.

00:34:40.498 --> 00:34:43.869
In closing, we are among the

00:34:43.869 --> 00:34:44.603
ranks of antitrust citizens who

00:34:44.603 --> 00:34:47.603
take this task upon ourselves

00:34:48.173 --> 00:34:48.640
exemplify it by the author

00:34:48.640 --> 00:34:49.407
david sedaris.

00:34:49.407 --> 00:34:51.743
If you listen to npr as we do,

00:34:51.743 --> 00:34:52.444
you probably will know that

00:34:52.444 --> 00:34:55.444
david sedaris trash story as

00:34:55.680 --> 00:34:56.381
good urban warrior as we

00:34:56.381 --> 00:34:57.116
soldier had equipped with a

00:34:57.116 --> 00:34:59.752
trash bag and a picker driven

00:34:59.752 --> 00:35:00.387
by the goal of a landscape

00:35:00.387 --> 00:35:02.787
devoid of man's detritus.

00:35:03.155 --> 00:35:03.889
Let us keep san francisco clean

00:35:03.889 --> 00:35:06.889
so visitors and residents alike

00:35:07.526 --> 00:35:08.193
can revel in its natural beauty

00:35:08.193 --> 00:35:10.193
and well-maintained parks.

00:35:11.290 --> 00:35:11.763
>> as I always said, we can

00:35:11.763 --> 00:35:14.867
walk and chew gum at the same

00:35:14.867 --> 00:35:17.867
time and pick up trash.

00:35:44.730 --> 00:35:46.730
Okay

00:35:50.837 --> 00:35:51.304
?

00:35:51.304 --> 00:35:53.304
>> all right.

00:35:53.939 --> 00:35:54.474
Now we will go to district nine

00:35:54.474 --> 00:35:54.907
supervisor fielder.

00:35:54.907 --> 00:35:56.907
>> thank you.

00:35:57.977 --> 00:35:58.411
I would like to welcome the man

00:35:58.411 --> 00:36:00.411
to the podium.

00:36:03.282 --> 00:36:06.282
Please come up la mayor.

00:36:07.387 --> 00:36:10.987
Today I am honoring a truly

00:36:11.570 --> 00:36:11.624
remarkable woman a pillar of

00:36:11.624 --> 00:36:13.624
strength, compassion

00:36:15.228 --> 00:36:15.795
and resilience.

00:36:15.795 --> 00:36:16.629
La moya la mayor.

00:36:16.629 --> 00:36:19.198
Abuela is the heart and soul

00:36:19.198 --> 00:36:19.698
behind the most cafe in the

00:36:19.698 --> 00:36:21.698
mission district.

00:36:23.102 --> 00:36:23.569
>> temos cafe is more than just

00:36:23.569 --> 00:36:25.569
a coffee shop.

00:36:26.806 --> 00:36:27.340
It's a refuge.

00:36:27.340 --> 00:36:28.108
>> a place where?

00:36:28.108 --> 00:36:30.343
A place where the worries of

00:36:30.343 --> 00:36:31.311
the outside world fall away.

00:36:31.311 --> 00:36:33.947
>> it's a space built on

00:36:33.947 --> 00:36:36.347
community connection and love.

00:36:37.317 --> 00:36:38.510
>> rooted deeply in the mayor's

00:36:38.510 --> 00:36:40.451
palestinian heritage and woven

00:36:41.922 --> 00:36:42.256
into the vibrant spirit of the

00:36:42.256 --> 00:36:42.990
mission.

00:36:42.990 --> 00:36:45.859
>> from the beginning la man

00:36:45.859 --> 00:36:46.593
made it her mission to serve

00:36:46.593 --> 00:36:49.593
not just coffee but humanity.

00:36:49.662 --> 00:36:50.397
she offers warmth

00:36:50.397 --> 00:36:53.397
and generosity to everyone who

00:36:54.367 --> 00:36:55.135
walks through the doors.

00:36:55.135 --> 00:36:55.902
>> whether it's a meal for

00:36:55.902 --> 00:36:58.605
someone in need or a seat at

00:36:58.605 --> 00:36:59.239
the table to celebrate life's

00:36:59.239 --> 00:37:01.239
important milestones her

00:37:02.142 --> 00:37:05.142
journey has not been easy.

00:37:05.712 --> 00:37:06.480
Coming to san francisco as a

00:37:06.480 --> 00:37:09.216
young woman from palestine, she

00:37:09.216 --> 00:37:09.950
faced cultural barriers,

00:37:09.950 --> 00:37:12.350
economic hardships and personal

00:37:12.686 --> 00:37:13.553
loss.

00:37:13.553 --> 00:37:16.220
>> there were times when middle

00:37:16.220 --> 00:37:16.757
eastern food was unfamiliar to

00:37:16.757 --> 00:37:17.391
the community and times when

00:37:17.391 --> 00:37:19.791
grief could have easily

00:37:20.294 --> 00:37:21.610
overwhelmed her.

00:37:21.610 --> 00:37:24.610
>> but la mer met every

00:37:24.331 --> 00:37:25.320
challenge with strength,

00:37:25.320 --> 00:37:27.432
resilience and an unwavering

00:37:28.835 --> 00:37:29.770
commitment to move forward.

00:37:29.770 --> 00:37:33.173
Each day she rises before dawn

00:37:33.173 --> 00:37:36.173
works long hours and continues

00:37:36.210 --> 00:37:36.878
to care for her family here

00:37:36.878 --> 00:37:39.878
and back home in palestine.

00:37:40.347 --> 00:37:41.115
>> even with so much on her

00:37:41.115 --> 00:37:41.549
shoulders she still makes time

00:37:41.549 --> 00:37:43.549
for herself.

00:37:44.118 --> 00:37:44.818
Showing a quiet strength that

00:37:44.818 --> 00:37:47.218
inspires everyone around her

00:37:47.955 --> 00:37:48.822
including myself.

00:37:48.822 --> 00:37:51.693
>> la mer has created more than

00:37:51.693 --> 00:37:51.993
a business she has created a

00:37:51.993 --> 00:37:53.993
home.

00:37:55.620 --> 00:37:55.597
Temos cafe is a bridge between

00:37:55.597 --> 00:37:55.997
cultures palestinian

00:37:55.997 --> 00:37:57.997
and latino.

00:37:58.733 --> 00:38:01.133
Two communities that share

00:38:01.536 --> 00:38:02.203
values of resilience, warmth

00:38:02.203 --> 00:38:02.636
and deep respect for family

00:38:02.636 --> 00:38:04.636
and tradition.

00:38:06.307 --> 00:38:06.974
She reminds us that leadership

00:38:06.974 --> 00:38:09.374
isn't about competition or

00:38:10.344 --> 00:38:11.145
titles.

00:38:11.145 --> 00:38:13.545
>> it's about standing strong

00:38:13.848 --> 00:38:14.582
and who you are leading with

00:38:14.582 --> 00:38:17.582
heart and building with love.

00:38:18.286 --> 00:38:18.986
>> today we honor la mia for

00:38:18.986 --> 00:38:21.986
the sanctuary she has created

00:38:22.590 --> 00:38:23.257
the countless lives she has

00:38:23.257 --> 00:38:26.257
touched and the example she

00:38:26.528 --> 00:38:26.895
sets for all of us in the

00:38:26.895 --> 00:38:27.529
community.

00:38:27.529 --> 00:38:30.529
She shows us that real

00:38:30.532 --> 00:38:31.990
community is built one

00:38:31.990 --> 00:38:33.499
connection at a time.

00:38:34.869 --> 00:38:35.570
Through small acts of kindness,

00:38:35.570 --> 00:38:37.970
through patience and through

00:38:38.306 --> 00:38:39.730
perseverance.

00:38:39.730 --> 00:38:42.730
>> on behalf of everyone who

00:38:42.142 --> 00:38:42.910
has been fortunate to walk

00:38:42.910 --> 00:38:43.177
through temos cafe thank you la

00:38:43.177 --> 00:38:45.177
mia.

00:38:46.448 --> 00:38:47.115
Your generous city, your

00:38:47.115 --> 00:38:47.749
strength and your beautiful

00:38:47.749 --> 00:38:50.149
spirit inspires us all.

00:38:50.785 --> 00:38:54.985
Thank you and GOD thank you for

00:38:57.492 --> 00:38:57.825
your thanks.

00:38:57.825 --> 00:38:59.825
Exactly.

00:39:03.332 --> 00:39:03.865
You make me cry.

00:39:03.865 --> 00:39:05.865
>> good afternoon.

00:39:06.835 --> 00:39:09.835
My name is lamia abas.

00:39:10.539 --> 00:39:14.139
The proud owner of themas cafe

00:39:14.409 --> 00:39:16.809
a palestinian family owned.

00:39:17.579 --> 00:39:21.179
>> we have been part of this

00:39:21.250 --> 00:39:24.250
community for 11 years and in

00:39:24.820 --> 00:39:25.521
that time we have learned that

00:39:25.521 --> 00:39:28.521
running a small business is

00:39:29.258 --> 00:39:32.258
about more than just coffee.

00:39:32.628 --> 00:39:33.261
>> it's about connection

00:39:33.261 --> 00:39:35.261
bringing people together.

00:39:40.169 --> 00:39:41.103
Our goal at teams has always

00:39:41.103 --> 00:39:44.573
been to make every person feel

00:39:44.573 --> 00:39:46.973
welcome and feel home.

00:39:48.744 --> 00:39:52.714
A team owns each cup of coffee

00:39:52.714 --> 00:39:56.314
has been a chance to build

00:39:56.786 --> 00:39:58.786
relationship share stories

00:40:00.656 --> 00:40:03.656
and contribute with the heart

00:40:04.226 --> 00:40:04.960
of the cesar chavez community.

00:40:04.960 --> 00:40:07.960
Running a small business has

00:40:08.831 --> 00:40:11.868
it's a challenge but it's also

00:40:11.868 --> 00:40:13.868
deeply rewarding.

00:40:15.972 --> 00:40:18.972
>> I hope to continue growing

00:40:19.208 --> 00:40:21.608
learning and serving our

00:40:22.878 --> 00:40:23.345
neighborhood for many more

00:40:23.345 --> 00:40:25.345
years to come.

00:40:27.416 --> 00:40:30.687
And thank you jackie for all

00:40:30.687 --> 00:40:31.354
the beautiful mice you see.

00:40:31.354 --> 00:40:33.354
>> I appreciate it.

00:40:55.278 --> 00:40:57.278
thank you.

00:40:58.581 --> 00:41:02.181
And next up we have district

00:41:02.652 --> 00:41:03.520
four supervisor and engardio

00:41:03.520 --> 00:41:05.520
colleagues.

00:41:07.457 --> 00:41:08.191
>> today I'd like to honor the

00:41:08.191 --> 00:41:10.591
late lieutenant colonel robert

00:41:10.827 --> 00:41:11.495
powell.

00:41:11.495 --> 00:41:12.129
He was the senior army

00:41:12.129 --> 00:41:14.529
instructor for the jrotc

00:41:15.131 --> 00:41:15.699
program at abraham lincoln high

00:41:15.699 --> 00:41:17.699
school for 28 years.

00:41:19.350 --> 00:41:19.769
During his tenure, lincoln's

00:41:19.769 --> 00:41:22.806
jrotc program was rated as one

00:41:22.806 --> 00:41:23.574
of the most successful ones

00:41:23.574 --> 00:41:24.174
in western united states by the

00:41:24.174 --> 00:41:26.574
department of the army.

00:41:26.810 --> 00:41:27.578
It was so well run that colonel

00:41:27.578 --> 00:41:30.213
powell also became the director

00:41:30.213 --> 00:41:30.881
of army instruction for all the

00:41:30.881 --> 00:41:33.881
jrotc programs in the san

00:41:33.983 --> 00:41:34.651
francisco school district.

00:41:34.651 --> 00:41:37.651
He taught his cadets many

00:41:37.721 --> 00:41:38.455
leadership skills that prepared

00:41:38.455 --> 00:41:41.225
them for life skills such as

00:41:41.225 --> 00:41:41.926
how to deal with conflicts with

00:41:41.926 --> 00:41:42.526
poise and grace and how to

00:41:42.526 --> 00:41:44.526
communicate succinctly

00:41:44.929 --> 00:41:45.696
and efficiently.

00:41:45.696 --> 00:41:48.465
He was a respected mentor not

00:41:48.465 --> 00:41:49.650
just to his own cadets but to

00:41:49.650 --> 00:41:49.433
students in the broader

00:41:49.433 --> 00:41:51.433
community.

00:41:51.768 --> 00:41:52.569
He did so by opening up the

00:41:52.569 --> 00:41:55.569
jrotc facilities to students to

00:41:55.772 --> 00:41:56.507
gather during lunch and after

00:41:56.507 --> 00:41:57.108
school and counseling teenagers

00:41:57.108 --> 00:41:59.277
who were going through

00:41:59.277 --> 00:42:00.110
challenges.

00:42:00.110 --> 00:42:02.947
Our own budget and finance

00:42:02.947 --> 00:42:03.614
clerk brant haley has served

00:42:03.614 --> 00:42:04.348
under colonel powell as a

00:42:04.348 --> 00:42:06.748
battalion commander at lincoln

00:42:06.984 --> 00:42:07.818
high school in 1994.

00:42:07.818 --> 00:42:10.487
He credits colonel powell for

00:42:10.487 --> 00:42:11.221
providing guidance and molding

00:42:11.221 --> 00:42:13.892
him into the effective public

00:42:13.892 --> 00:42:14.559
servant he is today.

00:42:14.559 --> 00:42:16.959
Before joining lincoln high

00:42:17.495 --> 00:42:18.362
school's jrotc program, colonel

00:42:18.362 --> 00:42:19.630
powell had a 23 year decorated

00:42:19.630 --> 00:42:22.630
career in the military, began

00:42:22.660 --> 00:42:22.733
at fort benning, georgia.

00:42:22.733 --> 00:42:23.670
Ri attended airborne jump

00:42:23.670 --> 00:42:25.670
school.

00:42:25.736 --> 00:42:26.437
He was later assigned a

00:42:26.437 --> 00:42:28.837
checkpoint charlie in germany,

00:42:29.840 --> 00:42:30.574
which was best known as a

00:42:30.574 --> 00:42:30.908
crossing between east and west

00:42:30.908 --> 00:42:32.908
berlin.

00:42:33.445 --> 00:42:34.179
He also served and was injured

00:42:34.179 --> 00:42:34.612
in vietnam where he received a

00:42:34.612 --> 00:42:36.612
purple heart.

00:42:37.482 --> 00:42:38.820
His other awards include a

00:42:38.820 --> 00:42:40.482
bronze star with valor

00:42:41.286 --> 00:42:42.530
and commendation award with

00:42:42.530 --> 00:42:44.889
valor for heroism and combat at

00:42:44.889 --> 00:42:45.723
a merit merit service medal.

00:42:45.723 --> 00:42:48.694
He retired from his military

00:42:48.694 --> 00:42:50.929
career here in san francisco at

00:42:50.929 --> 00:42:51.696
the presidio in 1982 and that's

00:42:51.696 --> 00:42:52.230
when he turned to servicing the

00:42:52.230 --> 00:42:54.230
youth at lincoln.

00:42:55.200 --> 00:42:57.200
Lieutenant colonel powell

00:42:57.836 --> 00:42:58.469
passed away peacefully APRIL

00:42:58.469 --> 00:42:59.337
13th at the age of 88.

00:42:59.337 --> 00:43:02.407
He is survived by his wife

00:43:02.407 --> 00:43:03.410
emily daughters robin

00:43:03.410 --> 00:43:05.576
and rhonda powell and the

00:43:05.576 --> 00:43:06.345
thousands of cadets at lincoln

00:43:06.345 --> 00:43:09.281
high school who he inspired to

00:43:09.281 --> 00:43:10.150
be their best selves.

00:43:10.150 --> 00:43:13.150
And colleagues are going to

00:43:13.585 --> 00:43:13.919
continue today at lincoln high

00:43:13.919 --> 00:43:14.553
school.

00:43:14.553 --> 00:43:17.188
I have the privilege of

00:43:17.188 --> 00:43:17.822
honoring some of the brightest

00:43:17.822 --> 00:43:18.456
and most hardworking young

00:43:18.456 --> 00:43:21.456
people from the sun sets.

00:43:21.526 --> 00:43:22.260
The outstanding students of

00:43:22.260 --> 00:43:22.927
abraham lincoln high school

00:43:22.927 --> 00:43:25.927
because they have had an

00:43:26.165 --> 00:43:26.832
exception all year both

00:43:26.832 --> 00:43:29.232
in academics and athletics.

00:43:30.350 --> 00:43:30.802
Let's start with academics.

00:43:30.802 --> 00:43:34.402
I would like the lincoln mock

00:43:36.307 --> 00:43:39.307
trial team to stand please.

00:43:42.715 --> 00:43:45.885
But for the lincoln mock trial

00:43:45.885 --> 00:43:46.485
team won their first ever

00:43:46.485 --> 00:43:48.485
citywide championship.

00:43:49.555 --> 00:43:50.155
The lincoln defense team

00:43:50.155 --> 00:43:50.823
appeared in the federal

00:43:50.823 --> 00:43:53.223
courthouse before a united

00:43:53.592 --> 00:43:54.359
states district court judge

00:43:54.359 --> 00:43:57.359
and defeated last year's winner

00:44:03.569 --> 00:44:06.569
st ignatius and after this

00:44:07.106 --> 00:44:07.806
historic victory they went on

00:44:07.806 --> 00:44:08.507
to compete at the state level

