01:16:48.259 --> 01:16:50.259
tragically murdered in 2006

01:16:51.295 --> 01:16:54.295
continue to await justice that

01:16:54.666 --> 01:16:55.467
has been too long denied them.

01:16:55.467 --> 01:16:56.235
The heartbreaking truth is that

01:16:56.235 --> 01:16:59.235
our reward program is currently

01:16:59.838 --> 01:17:00.505
structured is failing to serve

01:17:00.505 --> 01:17:03.108
the very families it was

01:17:03.108 --> 01:17:03.842
created for.

01:17:03.842 --> 01:17:05.842
Restrictive eligibility rules

01:17:06.911 --> 01:17:07.545
requiring a conviction before

01:17:07.545 --> 01:17:08.146
any payout disqualifying

01:17:08.146 --> 01:17:10.146
disqualifying anonymous

01:17:10.615 --> 01:17:11.316
tipsters and excluding

01:17:11.316 --> 01:17:13.716
individuals with a criminal

01:17:14.420 --> 01:17:15.120
record have created barriers

01:17:15.120 --> 01:17:15.721
that discourage people from

01:17:15.721 --> 01:17:17.721
coming coming forward.

01:17:18.624 --> 01:17:19.324
The legislation I am

01:17:19.324 --> 01:17:21.324
introducing today proposes

01:17:22.327 --> 01:17:22.994
updates that would allow

01:17:22.994 --> 01:17:23.762
