01:17:26.665 --> 01:17:27.650
of criminal charges not just

01:17:27.650 --> 01:17:29.650
convictions.

01:17:29.935 --> 01:17:30.503
Enable anonymous tipsters to

01:17:30.503 --> 01:17:30.970
receive rewards while

01:17:30.970 --> 01:17:32.970
preserving their

01:17:34.773 --> 01:17:35.441
confidentiality to end

01:17:35.441 --> 01:17:37.441
automatic disqualification

01:17:38.877 --> 01:17:39.611
based on a prior criminal

01:17:39.611 --> 01:17:42.347
history and to ensure rewards

01:17:42.347 --> 01:17:42.881
are not paid for knowingly

01:17:42.881 --> 01:17:44.881
false information.

